algorithm][].\n\n### julianEaster\n\nReturns the date of Julian Easter for a given year in the Julian Calender\n\n### orthodoxEaster\n\nReturns the date of Julian Easter for a given year in the Gregorian Calender\n\n## References\n\n- Date::Easter Perl Package <https://metacpan.org/pod/Date::Easter> Rich Bowen <rbowen@rcbowen.com>\n- <http://www.chariot.net.au/~gmarts/eastcalc.htm>\n- [Gaussian Easter algorithm][]\n\n## License\n\nCopyright (c) 2015 commenthol\n\nSoftware is released under [MIT][license].\n\n[license]: ./LICENSE\n[Gaussian Easter algorithm]: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gau%C3%9Fsche_Osterformel#Eine_erg.C3.A4nzte_Osterformel\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","gitHead":"43ac8695a22903de117286b6850f8eb17fb4d361","_id":"date-easter@1.0.0-0","_nodeVersion":"14.15.5","_npmVersion":"6.14.11","dist":{"integrity":"sha512-oWFN6qloH2k/U8j71CXOVOXoVFT/NLpXH1dxtfmApFl9KPGarULpHLJyrTxCnQpXXrwwS+hcpAMWiGGrfa9Tvw==","shasum":"07009823c31daac986304c81033e0c87c08371be","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/date-easter/-/date-easter-1.0.0-0.tgz","fileCount":10,"unpackedSize":11359,"npm-signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\nVersion: OpenPGP.js v3.0.13\r\nComment: https://openpgpjs.org\r\n\r\nwsFcBAEBCAAQBQJgJ//qCRA9TVsSAnZWagAAzZYP/3uiW5jjPmtxW0nCZKAt\nLKF2OaUvs8J+dFWIPfymG7QRmJnyFahpNgY2ET/ZFfJqbOluHJS6EUslVvfS\nONn0wI06JkrDx8SamosbUNvwQG8Zy/j4zsikkJU2S6fVDGdjUQM0EzWN3qM6\nc9x/GdYtDGKwEjqmHBrHEk6y8xR3DLFaFN40IfFV31GkgwyTG+IVbYc7TjTQ\nmC3S4RLBbGjTIBT0sgESYKoJZYWcJrwzyi+KI00Nscybo4KqksZ3VEwsu6O+\nDITgxxL89Fvhwv0CO9hmcqFD0BGpCtgft7hPR57/k3wp4LyarzXkg0falx7j\nKGgN5wQqdO9OXfyarxlL1mSIU6qCBhwNR1ypEyut9iz7NcaDLy3IzF3/71ps\nX4Q+8E0YQzoWzTgrZQsQWJ22WXHODTCVMRmaUXYkdlwAdgsrJhz3uNubneiH\nOQm/sqwfC8nn+rnuoMtHHzmiXjC9IMjDvEtU8ar9AbXYZjhvijLZpEXTFiNC\nNvQiU+U7aKVinnfnSYU7FNcLjCWfugCFqz3xxJ9VXnNU15dSjRBgKqpXaZ86\nreghPT8k0/nVOYvy4ltBQwGPhWzYzaRUlG3vnS5S/28RFWwIjVCgG0Qy7Pz+\nPULOvzukKgUudDK1jZBw1uGyKqjLYTV8jAr3GJ7C35vcaPljx/jnTRKdVVOS\ntVCZ\r\n=pvKy\r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-